.TH ORO-XPC 3 "" "Oro Runtime" "Oro Runtime API Manual"
.SH NAME
oro:xpc \- JavaScript API module
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
import * as module from 'oro:xpc'
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
oro:xpc is a JavaScript API module exposed by the Oro Runtime.
.SH REFERENCE
.TP
\fBavailability()\fR
Retrieves XPC availability information for the current platform.
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIPromise<{ available: boolean, reason?: string }>\fR
.TP
\fBconnect(options)\fR
Establishes an XPC connection.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIoptions\fR (object; required)
.br
\fIoptions.service\fR (string; required)
.br
\fIoptions.type\fR (\&'mach\-service' \\| 'named'; optional; default 'mach\-service')
.br
\fIoptions.listener\fR (boolean; optional; default false)
.br
\fIoptions.privileged\fR (boolean; optional; default false)
.br
\fIoptions.flags\fR (number; optional; default 0)
.br
\fIoptions.label\fR (string; optional)
.br
\fIoptions.pendingReplyTimeout\fR (number; optional; default 30000)
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIPromise<Connection>\fR
.TP
\fBdisconnectAll()\fR
Closes all tracked XPC connections.
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIPromise<void>\fR
.TP
\fBint64(value)\fR
Helper to encode a 64\-bit signed integer.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIvalue\fR (bigint \\| number \\| string; required)
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIobject\fR
.TP
\fBuint64(value)\fR
Helper to encode a 64\-bit unsigned integer.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIvalue\fR (bigint \\| number \\| string; required)
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIobject\fR
.TP
\fBdata(value, encoding)\fR
Helper to encode binary payloads as XPC data.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIvalue\fR (Buffer \\| ArrayBuffer \\| ArrayBufferView \\| string; required)
.br
\fIencoding\fR (XPCBufferEncoding; optional; default 'utf8')
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIobject\fR
.TP
\fBuuid(value)\fR
Helper to encode UUID payloads.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIvalue\fR (string \\| { toString(): string }; required)
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIXPCExplicitValue\fR
.TP
\fBConnection\fR
Documented variable exposed by this module.
.TP
\fBListener\fR
Documented variable exposed by this module.
